      "content": "hey, i'm studying for a law debate and trying to get real here. given all the recent SCOTUS rulings like Bruen, is there actually any legitimate legal argument left for strict gun control, or is it basically unconstitutional now? like, is there any way a regulation can even pass scrutiny anymore?",
